  "description": "XOFKEM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C137 H143 Al9 Ce7 N27 O79,2(C5 H5 N1),6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce1E (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2E (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce3E (Ce) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.899-3.980 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.90-103.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C159H171Al9Ce7N35O79.",
